//! A general-purpose 2D renderer that knows nothing about the game: one window, one
//! alpha-blended vertex-colour pipeline, two frames in flight, and the swapchain recreated when
//! the window's size changes. Each frame the program fills the vertices and the batches that
//! draw them through `Scene`; a batch is a range of the vertices under its own view-projection
//! matrix.

